13. Termination

13.1 This Agreement ends when the license ends, or when you stop using the
Software. You can end it at any time by deleting the Software and all copies.

13.2 We may end this Agreement without notice if you materially breach it, in
particular sections 3 or 4, and do not stop the breach within 14 days after we
ask you to.

13.3 When this Agreement ends, you must stop using the Software and delete all
copies. Sections 3, 9, 11, 12 and 14 continue to apply.


